    "narrative": "On April [XXX], 2025 at 12:41 AM PT a Waymo Autonomous Vehicle (\"Waymo AV\") operating in Venice, California was in a collision involving a van on [XXX] near [XXX]. \nThe Waymo AV was parked in-lane for a passenger drop-off facing southwest on [XXX] with hazard lights activated. A van that was stopped directly behind the Waymo AV began to maneuver around the stationary Waymo by crossing the yellow center line, entering the opposing lane of travel. As the van proceeded to the left of the stationary Waymo AV, the Waymo AV passenger opened the driver side rear door and the passenger side of the van made contact with the open driver side rear door of the Waymo AV. At the time of the impact, the Waymo AV's Level 4 ADS was engaged in autonomous mode. The passengers who were seated in the rear of the Waymo AV and the front passenger seat were not belted at the time of the collision, as they were likely preparing to exit the Waymo AV. Both vehicles sustained damage. \nWaymo is reporting this crash under Request No. 1 of Standing General Order 2021-01 because a vehicle involved was towed away. Waymo may supplement or correct its reporting with additional information as it may become available.",
